,"version":1},"findings":[{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Re-derive the apply() batch-form cutover inventory (the '17' and '7' test files) by running find_referencing_symbols on apply plus a name-as-string grep for 'apply(' raw-dict batches and plain-dict creates, and reconcile the result against the instrumented-run list instead of relying on the runtime trace alone.","cohort":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"criteria":["project.symbol-reference-completeness"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.1222,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan step 3 verbatim: 'the 17 test files that pass raw-dict batches to apply() and the 7 that build plain-dict creates (found by an instrumented run; all in file impact)'","An 'instrumented run' is a dynamic derivation: it captures only call sites executed during the trace, and resolves no structural references nor name-as-string occurrences — the two sweeps the rubric's re-derivation guidance requires."],"finding":"The apply() batch-form reference inventory — '17 test files that pass raw-dict batches to apply()' and '7 that build plain-dict creates' — is stated to have been derived by an instrumented (runtime-trace) run, not by a symbol-reference-graph sweep (find_referencing_symbols) plus a name-as-string grep. An instrumented run only observes call sites exercised at runtime, so its known failure mode is silently omitting references that are not executed during the trace.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff3a7dfe7a7fd05b6","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 3: 'Retarget onto typed Mutations the 17 test files that pass raw-dict batches to apply() and the 7 that build plain-dict creates (found by an instrumented run; all in file impact).'","norm_id":"n8f5f0af1409c484c","priority":0.7778,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A test that passes a raw-dict batch to apply() but is skipped/xfail/parametrize-deselected during the in